---
import Layout from '../components/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="About — Sneh Patel" description="About page">
  <section class="container py-16">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">About</h2>
    <p class="mb-4">Write a longer bio here. Describe what you do, technologies you like, and the kinds of projects you build.</p>

    <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-3">Skills</h3>
    <ul class="list-disc ml-5 text-slate-700">
      <li>Web development: HTML, CSS, JavaScript</li>
      <li>Frameworks: Astro, React, Next.js (adjust)</li>
      <li>Tooling: Git, Vercel, Tailwind CSS</li>
    </ul>

    <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-3">Resume</h3>
    <p>You can add a PDF at <code>/public/resume.pdf</code> and link to it:</p>
    <a href="/resume.pdf" class="text-accent">Download resume (PDF)</a>
  </section>
</Layout>